# =========================================================================
# crew_log.bcyr — what a crew's log costs (ADR 036).
#
# No oracle: the Rust line kept no log. A file of its own, as the roadmap's 2.7.1 asks of crew rows.
# The crew is `manager.bcyr`'s four-task sequential crew, run with no log, with a log whose store
# keeps nothing (what the log costs the crew: every event built, numbered and rendered), and with a
# log on the file store in `$TMPDIR` (that, and the writes and fsyncs, which are the disk's: on a
# tmpfs they are nearly nothing, on ext4 they are most of the row). Then a snapshot, and reading a
# four-task log back into a replay.
#
# Stdlib is auto-prepended from cyrius.cyml — do NOT include stdlib modules.
# =========================================================================

